<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Estate-Settlement on Berrytree.org</title><link>https://berrytree.org/tags/estate-settlement/</link><description>Recent content in Estate-Settlement on Berrytree.org</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://berrytree.org/tags/estate-settlement/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>George Berry (TX)</title><link>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/georgeberrytx/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/georgeberrytx/</guid><description>&lt;div class="ancestor-page"&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="You are here"&gt;&#10; &lt;ol&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"&gt;Ancestors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"&gt;Family Lines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li aria-current="page"&gt;George Berry (TX)&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- Schema.org BreadcrumbList --&gt;&#10;&lt;script type="application/ld+json"&gt;&#10;{&#10; "@context": "https://schema.org",&#10; "@type": "BreadcrumbList",&#10; "itemListElement": [&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://berrytree.org/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Ancestors", "item": "https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Family Lines", "item": "https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "name": "George Berry (TX)"}&#10; ]&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-chain"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 1&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-pac/"&gt;Robert Berry × Mary Williamson&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Princess Anne County, Virginia&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 2&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-oc/"&gt;Robert Berry × Elizabeth Cate&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Orange County, North Carolina&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-jr/"&gt;Robert Berry Jr. × Mary Waggoner&lt;/a&gt; — Orange County, NC → Fayette County, AL&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/georgeberrytx/"&gt;George Berry × Susanna Aldridge&lt;/a&gt; — Orange County, NC → Fayette County, AL → Texas&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-profile"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-details"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="profile-name"&gt;&lt;span class="profile-gen"&gt;Generation 4&lt;/span&gt;&#10; George Berry&#10; &lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;dl class="vital-stats"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Born&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;c. 1787, Orange County, North Carolina&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Died&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;Before 1850&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Married&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;Susanna Aldridge (married c. 1814; died between 1850 and March 1855, Fayette County, Alabama)&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Parents&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;Robert Berry Jr. and Mary Waggoner Berry&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/dl&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-timeline-link"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/timelines/"&gt;Explore in the Berry Family Timeline&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;George Berry&lt;/strong&gt; was born c. 1787 in Orange County North Carolina. George was killed in Texas before 1850. George had served in the North Carolina Militia in the war of 1812. He enlisted as a private in Capt. John Bradshaw&amp;rsquo;s Company in the North Carolina Militia. 1814 Muster: 4th Regiment, 7th Company. He was discharged as a private and his service made him eligible for land grants in Fayette County Alabama. George Berry&amp;rsquo;s service in Texas also made his heirs eligible for more land grants in Texas.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Susanna Aldridge Berry</title><link>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/susanna-aldridge-berry/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/susanna-aldridge-berry/</guid><description>&lt;div class="ancestor-page"&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="You are here"&gt;&#10; &lt;ol&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"&gt;Ancestors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"&gt;Family Lines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li aria-current="page"&gt;Susanna Aldridge Berry&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- Schema.org BreadcrumbList --&gt;&#10;&lt;script type="application/ld+json"&gt;&#10;{&#10; "@context": "https://schema.org",&#10; "@type": "BreadcrumbList",&#10; "itemListElement": [&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://berrytree.org/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Ancestors", "item": "https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Family Lines", "item": "https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "name": "Susanna Aldridge Berry"}&#10; ]&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-chain"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 1&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-pac/"&gt;Robert Berry × Mary Williamson&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Princess Anne County, Virginia&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 2&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-oc/"&gt;Robert Berry × Elizabeth Cate&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Orange County, North Carolina&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-jr/"&gt;Robert Berry Jr. × Mary Waggoner&lt;/a&gt; — Orange County, NC → Fayette County, AL&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/georgeberrytx/"&gt;George Berry × Susanna Aldridge&lt;/a&gt; — Orange County, NC → Fayette County, AL → Texas&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-profile"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-details"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="profile-name"&gt;&lt;span class="profile-gen"&gt;Generation 4&lt;/span&gt;&#10; Susanna (Susan) Aldridge Berry&#10; &lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;dl class="vital-stats"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Born&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;1792, Person County, North Carolina&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Died&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;Between 1850 and 12 March 1855, Fayette County, Alabama&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Married&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;George Berry (married c. 1814)&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Parents&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;Peter Aldridge and Judith Waggoner Aldridge, Person County, NC&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/dl&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-timeline-link"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/timelines/"&gt;Explore in the Berry Family Timeline&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 id="susanna-aldridge-berry"&gt;Susanna Aldridge Berry&lt;a class="anchor" href="#susanna-aldridge-berry"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Susanna Aldridge&lt;/strong&gt; was born in &lt;strong&gt;1792&lt;/strong&gt;, the daughter of &lt;strong&gt;Peter Aldridge&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Judith Waggoner Aldridge&lt;/strong&gt; of Person County, North Carolina. Her birth year comes from her age of 58 in the 1850 Fayette County, Alabama census.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>